    gmeow:description "Documentation for cue urn:gmeow:word-tone-cues:troubled:2:cue:worried. Definition: A declared word cue for a troubled reading, using worried, worrying, anxious. It supplies evidence about attributed words and does not assert the speaker's state. Original owning source: https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/lillith-observations. Defining release: urn:gmeow:word-tone-cues:troubled:2. Original declaration graph role: https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/boxABox. These are explanatory source metadata, not additional direct Cue predicates."@en .

